  message: "Closed by PR #3468 (commit 77c3b8270). Landed: ADR-0024 (Axis Declaration Template for Multi-Value Fields), four-part template (axis name / axiom / consumer pattern / enforcement) + seven-step declaration workflow. Wiring: AGENTS.md essentialization in Required Checks naming the practice for any PR adding a multi-value field to a core dataclass; audit playbook Step 5 + Step 6 (both Deprecate and Document outcomes) forward-reference ADR-0024; docs/concept-axes.md preamble points at ADR-0024 as the template (regenerated). ADR-0023 retained as the worked example; ADR-0024 is the abstract template future axes (Symbol.kind, evidence_type, etc.) instantiate. Three open questions in Draft status: retroactive ADR-0015 (dataflow access modes) registry-ization; pre-commit detection of new multi-value field additions; section vocabulary normalization. Pre-commit detection sub-question is mentioned in ADR-0024 §Decision as a future tracker-able if documentation channel proves insufficient — not filed as a separate item now since it's premature."  # 8537
